Description: SEC: Avoid infinite loops for incomplete ASCII85 and ASCIIHex inline images
 Fixes an infinite loop (CWE-835) when parsing crafted PDFs containing
 incomplete ASCII85 / ASCIIHex inline image data. When stream.read() returns
 no further bytes, the decode loops previously never terminated because the
 buffered data from read_non_whitespace() masked the end-of-stream condition.
 The fix tracks the freshly-read bytes and raises PdfReadError on EOF, and
 aligns the _read_inline_image end-of-stream exception type and messages.
CVE: CVE-2026-59935
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/commit/5a33a46416aa1ae6c025ff90a3cca57631fdafd2
